TI  - Universal Interatomic Potentials as Configuration-Space Generators for One-Shot and Iterative Fine-Tuning of Ab Initio-Accurate Material-Specific Models
AU  - Jonas Hänseroth
AU  - Aaron Flötotto
AU  - Christian Dreßler
